those shoes? I really like them  :)[\/quote]\nThanks! I got them from Shoemetro.com. But they&#039;re available other places as well. It&#039;s Enzo Angiolini Aiza.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896135,"PostDate":1431511746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 13 May 2015 - 10:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281357\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281357-yj2cute\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">yj2cute<\/span><\/a> Where did you find those shoes? I really like them\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! I got them from Shoemetro.com. But they're available other places as well. It's Enzo Angiolini Aiza.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":