 on Ebay. The email responses come back thru as <a href='mailto:ebridalstore@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>ebridalstore@hotmail.com<\/a>.<br \/> <br \/> I gotta ask (since I love the organization of the web site!) has anyone on BDW that we know if actually ordered and received a duoshong dress yet? And what are the prices like? I'm trying to weed through posts now..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Savannah<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/i17.photobucket.com\/albums\/b85\/QuadMom\/Kids1linecollage.jpg'>http:\/\/i17.photobucket.com\/albums\/b8...inecollage.jpg<\/a><strong class='bbc'>The Fab Four (my quads) Meryn, Kellen, Nico & Layla<\/strong><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt265ad.aspx'>http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt265ad.aspx<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/williamandsavannah\/index.html'>http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/williamandsavannah\/index.html<\/a><strong class='bbc'>20 STD's w. pre-lim RSVP sent 6\/15\/09: 7 \"Yes\" so far\/10 guests total!<\/strong>","Email":"savvy1120@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1190575920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207776.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BillysBride","Id":207776,"Name":"BillysBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28e94d0fb6ee4f9259fe7060355804da","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table 