{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb9a54d14f8271340ba956ed05b30cea","RawContent":"My duosheng dress came today (I ordered it May 11), and I have nothing but good things to say about the whole experience. Sabrina Zhang was fantastic with answering my many, many emails throughout and the quality of the dress is very nice. I ordered it with a lace up back, and I really can&#039;t do it myself, so sorry the dress is saggy at the top in the photo. I asked for a replica Maggie dress from 2005, but all white and a ruffle at the top. It did come in a hanging bag, but is extremely wrinkled. I think the dry cleaners can easily fix this. Again, I think the quality is equal to anything else I have seen (note, I have not tried on dresses above $1000). I asked for &amp;quot;best quality&amp;quot;, which cost extra, and including the $30 shipping, this dress was $287. Please ask me any questions about Dousheng and I will answer if I can. I sure hope the top fits better when someone else can lace me up, that is my only complaint about the dress. \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b115\/coffee_shop_girl\/dress1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b115\/coffee_shop_girl\/dressphoto1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":743130,"PostDate":1246380068,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My duosheng dress came today (I ordered it May 11), and I have nothing but good things to say about the whole experience. Sabrina Zhang was fantastic with answering my many, many emails throughout and the quality of the dress is very nice. I ordered it with a lace up back, and I really can't do it myself, so sorry the dress is saggy at the top in the photo. I asked for a replica Maggie dress from 2005, but all white and a ruffle at the top. It did come in a hanging bag, but is extremely wrinkled. I think the dry cleaners can easily fix this. Again, I think the quality is equal to anything else I have seen (note, I have not tried on dresses above $1000). I asked for \"best quality\", which cost extra, and including the $30 shipping, this dress was $287. Please ask me any questions about Dousheng and I will answer if I can. I sure hope the top fits better when someone else can lace me up, that is my only complaint about the dress. <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b115\/coffee_shop_girl\/dress1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b115\/coffee_shop_girl\/dressphoto1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"violets@neb.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"Grou