ied about....I don&#039;t mind if it&#039;s not exact I just don&#039;t want it really far off so that it&#039;s not even the same effect. Thanks guys!","Attachments":[],"Id":866272,"PostDate":1254327619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anybody bought a dress with intricate beading? This is the only part i'm slightly worried about....I don't mind if it's not exact I just don't want it really far off so that it's not even the same effect. Thanks guys!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b319d989c4d64094f9f0d53ccfd5aa1","RawContent":"Has anybody bought a dress with intricate beading? This is the only part i&#039;m slightly worried about....I don&#039;t mind if it&#039;s not exact I just don&#039;t want it really far off so that it&#039;s not even the same effect. Thanks guys!","Attachments":[],"Id":866273,"PostDate":1254327635,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anybody bought a dress with intricate beading? This is the only part i'm slightly worried about....I don't mind if it's not exact I just don't want it really far off so that it's not even the same effect. Thanks guys!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cd96204900cfb488376f44686c5915a","RawContent":"kjt1985\n Hi ive been looking at a dress for Pauls daughter to wear at our wedding.The reviews on it say the beading is perfect and everyone has said that they are very pleased with there purchase.The only complaint there has been is that the dress has been a little short.So anyone thinking of buying any short dresses just needs to maybe custom order the length.","Attachments":[],"Id":866607,"PostDate":1254342414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                kjt1985<br \/> Hi ive been looking at a dress for Pauls daughter to wear at our wedding.The reviews on it say the beading is perfect and everyone has said that they are very pleased with there purchase.The only complaint there has been is that the dress has been a little short.So anyone thinking of buying any short dresses just needs to maybe custom order the length.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roo6637@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208337577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roo66","Id":209110,"Name":"roo66","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73d1390676e781a0d9bb0cf8c650ae73","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;roo66&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;kjt1985\n Hi ive been looking at a dress for Pauls daughter to wear at our wedding.The reviews on it say the beading is perfect and everyone has said that they are very pleased with there purchase.The only complaint there has been is that the dress has been a little short.So anyone thinking of buying any short dresses just needs to maybe custom order the length.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;GREAT! Thanks. I&#039;ve actually tried on the dress I want and have close up pictures of the detail so that should help too (instead of going off a distant stock photo). Thanks again!","Attachments":[],"Id":866635,"PostDate":1254343111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>roo66<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">kjt1985<br \/> Hi ive been looking at a dress for Pauls daughter to wear at our wedding.The reviews on it say the beading is perfect and everyone has said that they are very pleased with there purchase.The only complaint there has been is that the dress has been a little short.So anyone thinking of buying any short dresses just needs to maybe custom order the length.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>GREAT! Thanks. I've actually tried on the dress I want and have close up pictures of the detail so that should help too (instead of going off a distant stock photo). Thanks again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9957c2714c4eb6d42754ec2f3ec00b3a","RawContent":"Finally decided to purchase my reception dress from landybridal! It has an intricate design and also some beading to it. Its a short bridal reception dress(not on her site so it is a custom order) ill post the original and the outcome as soon as i get it with my review! Only thing i can actually review on as of now is her Customer Service.. It is sensationally awesome! Roselin has been excellent so far with all my crazy questions and changes! lol... So far so good, looking forward to the outcome!","Attachments":[],"Id":866871,"PostDate":1254350359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Finally decided to purchase my reception dress from landybridal! It has an intricate design and also some beading to it. Its a short bridal reception dress(not on her site so it is a custom order) ill post the original and the outcome as soon as i get it with my review! Only thing i can actually review on as of now is her Customer Service.. It is sensationally awesome! Roselin has been excellent so far with all my crazy questions and changes! lol... So far so good, looking forward to the outcome!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kuteliya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1240858098,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217092.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"**~Linda~**","Id":217092,"Name":"**~Linda~**","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8c0b2c2f54d59d9d2724d20e9963ad2","RawContent":"I have mixed feelings about all this I bought one off ebey that ened up being almost 600 with upgraded matirals and shipping and all and it was horrid....I have big boob and a little waist so when I orderd a 38-27-36 they made it for an a cup and my boobs fall out and have 5inches of fabric on my back . How ever I was still in need of a TTD dress so I just got one for under 200 from Light in the box..this time I didn&#039;t custom size it I just ordered a size and will take it in aliitle if needed hopfully. As for consumerism I bought my $5000.00 dress I can buy a couple cheap ones. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":866909,"PostDate":1254352072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have mixed feelings about all this I bought one off ebey that ened up being almost 600 with upgraded matirals and shipping and all and it was horrid....I have big boob and a little waist so when I orderd a 38-27-36 they made it for an a cup and my boobs fall out and have 5inches of fabric on my back . How ever I was still in need of a TTD dress so I just got one for under 200 from Light in the box..this time I didn't custom size it I just ordered a size and will take it in aliitle if needed hopfully. As for consumerism I bought my $5000.00 dress I can buy a couple cheap ones. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"re