 post pics once I have it.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I just got a price quote from Duosheng and they gave me a high quality fabric and lower quality fabric price, did you this option too? It&#039;s hard to know what to pick without seeing it...\n \n Any advice would be great!","Attachments":[],"Id":875270,"PostDate":1254934279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>*tanga*<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Yep - I ordered <a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?line=d&style=SD5204' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>this one<\/a> from <a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/fen\/index1.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Duosheng<\/a> the whole bodice is beaded and I am excited\/freaking out as it arrives this month. I will post pics once I have it.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I just got a price quote from Duosheng and they gave me a high quality fabric and lower quality fabric price, did you this option too? It's hard to know what to pick without seeing it...<br \/> <br \/> Any advice would be great!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"