ce had I ordered it in a bridal store. Also my dress has so much beading I didn't mind paying extra for it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/2142\/150\/20100227\/We+Get+Married\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/2142\/...ied\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"joeymosis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233646244,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214576.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*tanga*","Id":214576,"Name":"*tanga*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7e6bab3a8b352d53370b5957a66d2d5","RawContent":"Hey Tanga,\n \n do they send you pictures of some of the work they&#039;ve done that is similar to what you ordered? I&#039;m really tempted to order my dress through them but am also really scared that it will be nothing like what I wanted....\n \n Help!","Attachments":[],"Id":876457,"PostDate":1255006231,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Tanga,<br \/> <br \/> do they send you pictures of some of the work they've done that is similar to what you ordered? I'm really tempted to order my dress through them but am also really scared that it will be nothing like what I wanted....<br \/> <br \/> Help!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100602\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/8727\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8727\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"heather@integralmedia.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238521101,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216316.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vallarta_2009","Id":216316,"Name":"Vallarta_2009","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f19303e66b715fea6190f773a4f45c7a","RawContent":"Just FYI: I emailed littlecoral.com to see how long it takes them to make dresses. I had heard Landys Bridal takes about a month but Little Coral said wedding dresses take 45-60 days. I guess it would depend on how big it is and how much hand work there is to do as well. It might also be possible to get a rush on it but its something to keep in mind.","Attachments":[],"Id":876554,"PostDate":1255010776,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just FYI: I emailed littlecoral.com to see how long it takes them to make dresses. I had heard Landys Bridal takes about a month but Little Coral said wedding dresses take 45-60 days. I guess it would depend on how big it is and how much hand work there is to do as well. It might also be possible to get a rush on it but its something to keep in mind.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6997672924058c6d4c23b94ffe630d75","RawContent":"Duosheng also mentions they take 45-60 days to make or more if best quality.\n \n I&#039;m wondering if I should opt for cheaper quality since it&#039;s just going to be a TTD dress... $500 is a lot for a TTD!","Attachments":[],"Id":876873,"PostDate":1255020748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=