ittenHeart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e85c9041180e43aa24b3f0228dd655c2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KittenHeart&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Duosheng also mentions they take 45-60 days to make or more if best quality.\n \n I&#039;m wondering if I should opt for cheaper quality since it&#039;s just going to be a TTD dress... $500 is a lot for a TTD!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I would definitley go for the cheaper TTD dress. I&#039;m going to wear my actual wedding dress for TTD. I figure i&#039;ll only ever wear it during these times so i don&#039;t mind if it gets ripped, dirty etc...the memories will be there. I&#039;m going to risk it and order online and hope it turns out so I know i won&#039;t be reselling, it&#039;ll just be one of the MANY items of clothing that sits in my closet for years that i can&#039;t part with...lol","Attachments":[],"Id":877327,"PostDate":1255034677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n              