           }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Girls,<br \/> In previous posts I mentioned that I had previously bought a knock off wedding dress and that I was getting another one! <br \/> Well yesterday It came!! Woohoo, I have taken some photos and I will post soon. Keep tuned!<br \/> <br \/> For all your girlies thinking off getting a knock off. I say do it! Cheap as chips and LANDYBRIDAL are fantastic!! NO COMPLAINTS just pure happiness <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i45.tinypic.com\/111l7xk.jpg\">http:\/\/i45.tinypic.com\/111l7xk.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;131\/st\/20100510\/e\/Our+Hawaiian+Wedding\/dt\/15\/k\/ae98\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ae98\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"christie_bielaczek@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1218889923,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211218.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Island Princess","Id":211218,"Name":"Island Princess","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8cdcb40f9a76c082910f0d8d89addcf","RawContent":"Yay!! I&#039;ve requested a quote and am just waiting to hear back!","Attachments":