"PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KittenHeart","Id":211300,"Name":"KittenHeart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df76cc17770c1199786fe9b71851d679","RawContent":"Island Princess - that looks amazing on you! I especially love the shoes! \n \n Got my quote today...$416 for the dress I want including shipping. This was a bit higher than I had wanted BUT its nowhere near the $1200 price tag of the original....guess I have to get my other dress sold now...","Attachments":[],"Id":884239,"PostDate":1255529656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Island Princess - that looks amazing on you! I especially love the shoes! <br \/> <br \/> Got my quote today...$416 for the dress I want including shipping. This was a bit higher than I had wanted BUT its nowhere near the $1200 price tag of the original....guess I have to get my other dress sold now...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b27d5bc80cc75bf09a0f2a447a75ee16","RawContent":"Holy cow!!! IMMMMMM so excited to get the reception dress i ordered from Landy Bridal! You girls look GORGEOUS in your dresses!","Attachments":[],"Id":884436,"PostDate":1255535612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Holy cow!!! IMMMMMM so excited to get the reception dress i ordered from Landy Bridal! You girls look GORGEOUS in your dresses!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kuteliya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1240858098,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217092.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"**~Linda~**","Id":217092,"Name":"**~Linda~**","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d80261a2c56d83f174e68f7eef9200b","RawContent":"I know exactly how you feel Melissa- \n I&#039;ve been bad keeping up on this thread but I ordered and received a dress from Duosheng (it was &amp;quot;Binefar&amp;quot; by San Patrick). It&#039;s well made, the quality and materials are nice, but it just doesn&#039;t fit the way I had in mind. I was initially a bit let down but I&#039;m going to take it to a seamstress and have alterations done. That&#039;s only fair, as you&#039;d do the same thing with a local dress so I shouldn&#039;t skip this part! \n I don&#039;t have a photobucket account but I&#039;d be happy to email my pics to someone if they will upload them here. I know, I really need to learn how to upload photos &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Jacylinda- your dress\/photos\/everything looks AWESOME! I haven&#039;t spoken to you in a while but I&#039;ve been thinking bout ya!\n \n Island Princess- that deep sweetheart neckline rocks! Nice choice!!","Attachments":[],"Id":884582,"PostDate":1255540290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know exactly how you feel Melissa- <br \/> I've been bad keeping up on this thread but I ordered and received a dress from Duosheng (it was \"Binefar\" by San Patrick). It's well made, the quality and materials are nice, but it just doesn't fit the way I had in mind. I was initially a bit let down but I'm going to take it to a seamstress and have alterations done. That's only fair, as you'd do the same thing with a local dress so I shouldn't skip this part! <br \/> I don't have a photobucket account but I'd be happy to email my pics to someone if they will upload them here. I know, I really need to learn how to upload photos <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Jacylinda- your dress\/photos\/everything looks AWESOME! I haven't spoken to you in a while but I've been thinking bout ya!<br \/> <br \/> Island Princess- that deep sweetheart neckline rocks! Nice choice!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geminigem615@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1231200988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213622.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KimmyG","Id":213622,"Name":"KimmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11816faa7df9dcc1acd427909b86d707","RawContent":"Alright ladies, here is Kimmy&#039;s &amp;quot;Binefar&amp;quot; by San Patrick, Duosheng dress:\n \n On the model:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/SanPatrick8854.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The Duosheng dress on a mannequin:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/CHIC-171-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Kimmy in dress front:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2325.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Kimmy close up front:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2332.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Kimmy back:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2326.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Kimmy close up back with cute undies :)\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2328.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Kimmy with Mermaid style back that she wants tailored that way:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2368.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Thanks so much for sharing with us! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":884704,"PostDate":1255544541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Alright ladies, here is Kimmy's \"Binefar\" by San Patrick, Duosheng dress:<br \/> <br \/> On the model:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/SanPatrick8854.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The Duosheng dress on a mannequin:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/CHIC-171-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Kimmy in dress front:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2325.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Kimmy close up front:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2332.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Kimmy back:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2326.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Kimmy close up back with cute undies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2328.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Kimmy with Mermaid style back that she wants tailored that way:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i44.photobucket.com\/albums\/f22\/johnnygirl777\/DSCF2368.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much for sharing with us! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.net