w Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thank you so much KittenHeart (Amy) for posting the photos <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> I do think it looks frumpy from the front, but that's nothing a good tailor can't fix <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Heck no, i dont see frump of any kind! The dress is gorgeous but like you said just needs to be adjusted in the right places <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kuteliya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1240858098,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217092.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"**~Linda~**","Id":217092,"Name":"**~Linda~**","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d093a4058175f56821e8205fc3c39c35","RawContent":"Kimmy...I&#039;m with the others....you look gorgeous in your dress!!","Attachments":[],"Id":885363,"PostDate":1255563346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Kimmy...I'm with the others....you look gorgeous in your dress!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"classadiva@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1252270204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221365.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"classadiva","Id":221365,"Name":"classadiva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79b19c238a30f597174b9173a9d76f0c","RawContent":"I just got my TTD dress today from Light in the box. Now where it definitely dosn&#039;t look just like the dress I ordered. I like the dress and its well made and should look good for my TTD. One suggestion though I&#039;m a bit big in the boobs so I ordered a size bigger figuring I would just take it in a bit ....NO TAKING IT IN NECESSARY... I might still need to loose 5 pounds to fit in it properly... even though they list the measurements I would order up its always easier to take it in.","Attachments":[],"Id":885409,"PostDate":1255565164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just got my TTD dress today from Light in the box. Now where it definitely dosn't look just like the dress I ordered. I like the dress and its well made and should look good for my TTD. One suggestion though I'm a bit big in the boobs so I ordered a size bigger figuring I would just take it in a bit ....NO TAKING IT IN NECESSARY... I might still need to loose 5 pounds to fit in it properly... even though they list the measurements I would order up its always easier to take it in.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv143\/graybeee\/Momscamra111.jpg?t=1254695867\">http:\/\/i678.photobucket.com\/albums\/v...g?t=1254695867<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt40c7b.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt40c7b.aspx<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt3dd21.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt3dd21.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Jillleanneadler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253503032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221829.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":194,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jtswedding","Id":221829,"Name":"Jtswedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d7d4f2e19c2f6c2382a75b9bf2c60