mber","JoinDate":1253503032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221829.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":194,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jtswedding","Id":221829,"Name":"Jtswedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3701185b145369aa32383c66e4283c67","RawContent":"So I saw another bride on here ordered a dress from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/stores.shop.ebay.com\/jindress88__W0QQ_armrsZ1\"&gt;eBay Store - jin.dress88:&lt;\/a&gt; Is there anybody else who has? They quoted me $164 to make my dress whereas landy bridal quoted $420 with shipping. If I could get my dress for $164 I would be ECSTATIC!!! But I&#039;m also slightly apprehensive. But how much better could the landy bridal dress really be&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;? Her&#039;s looked like it was really good quality...","Attachments":[],"Id":892499,"PostDate":1256064055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I saw another bride on here ordered a dress from <a href='http:\/\/stores.shop.ebay.com\/jindress88__W0QQ_armrsZ1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>eBay Store - jin.dress88:<\/a> Is there anybody else who has? They quoted me $164 to make my dress whereas landy bridal quoted $420 with shipping. If I could get my dress for $164 I would be ECSTATIC!!! But I'm also slightly apprehensive. But how much better could the landy bridal dress really be<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>? Her's looked like it was really good quality...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e81c2de4d5a94a176ab7edbcf202468","RawContent":"Well, I know with jin.dress if the dress wasn&#039;t perfect it is returnable - so you could always order it and if its not the quality you want, return it for a refund. Just check the return clause carefully - I&#039;m pretty sure you could return it no matter what, but check to be on the safe side. \n \n In my dress thread, another bride mentioned she ordered from there as well - maybe you could ask her to let you know how hers turned out when she gets them??","Attachments":[],"Id":892595,"PostDate":1256068114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well, I know with jin.dress if the dress wasn't perfect it is returnable - so you could always order it and if its not the quality you want, return it for a refund. Just check the return clause carefully - I'm pretty sure you could return it no matter what, but check to be on the safe side. <br \/> <br \/> In my dress thread, another bride mentioned she ordered from there as well - maybe you could ask her to let you know how hers turned out when she gets them??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>21 people + Bride & Groom booked!!<\/strong><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20100414\/e\/Beth+and+Jon%27s+Wedding%21\/dt\/1\/k\/8e20\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8e20\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bholthof@connect.carleton.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1247538305,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219399.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bholthof","Id":219399,"Name":"bholthof","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"