icy: \n \n before delivery the item , we must check the size and confirm item perfect . when you receive the item , if you find any question , please contact us . we will reply within 48 hours .\n \n if the dress not fit you , you can sent the item back with 7 days , we can refund your dress cost (not include postage) , or you can choose another the same price dress from us ,we can free make for you ,\n \n if the dress size wrong because us mistake , you can sent the item back , we can free mend the dress for you . if not us mistake , you can sent back , and pay for us postage ,we also can free mend the dress for you .","Attachments":[],"Id":892622,"PostDate":1256069027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's her return policy: <br \/> <br \/> before delivery the item , we must check the size and confirm item perfect . when you receive the item , if you find any question , please contact us . we will reply within 48 hours .<br \/> <br \/> if the dress not fit you , you can sent the item back with 7 days , we can refund your dress cost (not include postage) , or you can choose another the same price dress from us ,we can free make for you ,<br \/> <br \/> if the dress size wrong because us mistake , you can sent the item back , we can free mend the dress for you . if not us mistake , you can sent back , and pay for us postage ,we also can free mend the dress for you .\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>21 people + Bri