us mistake , you can sent back , and pay for us postage ,we also can free mend the dress for you .&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That&#039;s great! Any chance I can get you to post some super close pictures of the detail on your dress?","Attachments":[],"Id":892645,"PostDate":1256069731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>bholthof<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Here's her return policy: <br \/> <br \/> before delivery the item , we must check the size and confirm item perfect . when you receive the item , if you find any question , please contact us . we will reply within 48 hours .<br \/> <br \/> if the dress not fit you , you can sent the item back with 7 days , we can refund your dress cost (not include postage) , or you can choose another the same price dress from us ,we can free make for you ,<br \/> <br \/> if the dress size wrong because us mistake , you can sent the item back , we can free mend the dress for you . if not us mistake , you can sent back , and pay for us postage ,we also can free mend the dress for you .<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That's great! Any chance I can get you to post some super close pictures of the detail on your dress?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abf8638e193a19659d3a2db171d023a9","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;bholthof&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Here&#039;s her return policy: \n \n before delivery the item , we must check the size and confirm item perfect . when you receive the item , if you find any question , please contact us . we will reply within 48 hours .\n \n if the dress not fit you , you can sent the item back with 7 days , we can refund your dress cost (not include postage) , or you can choose another the same price dress from us ,we can free make for you ,\n \n if the dress size wrong because us mistake , you can sent the item back , we can free mend the dress for you . if not us mistake , you can sent back , and pay for us postage ,we also can free mend the dress for you .&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;And did you try on dresses in a store first? How does the quality compare? I&#039;d just rather stick with Landy if there&#039;s going to be a huge difference. If not, i&#039;m totally about saving some more money!!","Attachments":[],"Id":892647,"PostDate":1256069799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>bholthof<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Here's her return policy: <br \/> <br \/> before delivery the item , we must check the size and confirm item perfect . when you receive the item , if you find any question , please contact us . we will reply within 48 hours .<br \/> <br \/> if the dress not fit you , you can sent the item back with 7 days , we can refund your dress cost (not include postage) , or you can choose another the same price dress from us ,we can free make for you ,<br \/> <br \/> if the dress size wrong because us mistake , you can sent the item back , we can free mend the dress for you . if not us mistake , you can sent back , and pay for us postage ,we also can free mend the dress for you .<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>And did you try on dresses in a store first? How does the quality compare? I'd just rather stick with Landy if there's going to be a huge difference. If not, i'm totally about saving some more money!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8eaf3f552a95433693792bf0d58f06cb","RawContent":"Hi ladies,\n \n I got my dress made from Gianinarbridal on eBay. I contacted them directly to get a custom order. I tried to read a lot of reviews before deciding whether to go with them. I also tried on dresses at stores, but just couldn&#039;t find something perfect. I tried everywhere from David&#039;s Bridal to various boutiques with dresses ranging from $400 - $4000. A lot had elements that I liked, but elements that I didn&#039;t like, so I decided just to get one made.\n \n I was really really happy with the way the dress turned out! The quality was great. My dress was white silk taffeta. The fit was PERFECT - I mean, fit like a glove perfect! It was kind of scary that they could do that just based on some numbers I sent them. Even with shipping, the dress was cheaper than the drycleaning cost of a wedding dress!! I would definately recommend this company. If you have any questions about my experience, please feel free to PM me. Oh, one small drawback was that I asked for a bustle, a crinoline and veil, and they completely forgot to include those in the order. By the time they shipped the dress, it was too late to get those added to my order. I mean, they also didn&#039;t charge me for them either, so it was all ok. But overall, my experience was very positive :)","Attachments":[],"Id":892662,"PostDate":1256070400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies,<br \/> <br \/> I got my dress made from Gianinarbridal on eBay. I contacted them directly to get a custom order. I tried to read a lot of reviews before deciding whether to go with them. I also tried on dresses at stores, but just couldn't find something perfect. I tried everywhere from David's Bridal to various boutiques with dresses ranging from $400 - $4000. A lot had elements that I liked, but elements that I didn't like, so I decided just to get one made.<br \/> <br \/> I was really really happy with the way the dress turned out! The quality was great. My dress was white silk taffeta. The fit was PERFECT - I mean, fit like a glove perfect! It was kind of scary that they could do that just based on some numbers I sent them. Even with shipping, the dress was cheaper than the drycleaning cost of a wedding dress!! I would definately recommend this company. If you have any questions about my experience, please feel free to PM me. Oh, one small drawback was that I asked for a bustle, a crinoline and veil, and they completely forgot to include those in the order. By the time they shipped the dress, it was too late to get those added to my order. I mean, they also didn't charge me for them either, so it was all ok. But overall, my experience was very positive <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Janet<\/i><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/janet-s-bahia-principe-akumal-review-8-15-09-a-48951\/\">Our Bahia Principe Akumal Wedding Review (8.15.09)<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20090815\/e\/Our+Destination+Wedding\/k\/c708\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...c708\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcygordon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236617985,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215627.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jananaz","Id":215627,"Name":"Jananaz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"042fc4c516e936f4f1e22cfe02cdd603","RawContent":"Hi ladies,\n \n I got my dress made from Gianinarbridal on eBay. I contacted them directly to get a custom order. I tried to read a lot of reviews before deciding whether to go with them. I also tried on dresses at stores, but just couldn&#039;t find something perfect. I tried everywhere from David&#039;s Bridal to various boutiques with dresses ranging from $400 - $4000. A lot had elements that I liked, but elements that I didn&#039;t like, so I decided just to get one made. It was awesome because I could choose the elements of different dresses that I liked and they were able to put it together for me.\n \n I was really really happy with the way the dress turned out! The quality was great. My dress was white silk taffeta. The fit was PERFECT - I mean, fit like a glove perfect! It was kind of scary that they could do that just based on some numbers I sent them. Even with shipping, the dress was cheaper than the drycleaning cost of a wedding dress!! I would definately recommend this company. If you have any questions about my experience, please feel free to PM me. Oh, one small drawback was that I asked for a bustle, a crinoline and veil, and they completely forgot to include those in the order. By the time they shipped the dress, it was too late to get those added to my order. I mean, they also didn&#039;t charge me for them either, so it was all ok. But overall, my experience was very positive :)","Attachments":[],"Id":892663,"PostDate":1256070417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies,<br \/> <br \/> I got my dress made from Gianinarbridal on eBay. I contacted them directly to get a custom order. I tried to read a lot of reviews before deciding whether to go with them. I also tried on dresses at stores, but just couldn't find something perfect. I tried everywhere from David's Bridal to various boutiques with dresses ranging from $400 - $4000. A lot had elements that I liked, but elements that I didn't like, so I decided just to get one made. It was awesome because I could choose the elements of different dresses that I liked and they were able to put it together for me.<br \/> <br \/> I was really really happy with the way the dress turned out! The quality was great. My dress was white silk taffeta. The fit was PERFECT - I mean, fit like a glove perfect! It was kind of scary that they could do that just based on some numbers I sent them. Even with shipping, the dress was cheaper than the drycleaning cost of a wedding dress!! I would definately recommend this company. If you have any questions about my experience, please feel free to PM me. Oh, one small drawback was that I asked for a bustle, a crinoline and veil, and they completely forgot to include those in the order. By the time they shipped the dress, it was too late to get those added to my order. I mean, they also didn't charge me for them either, so it was all ok. But overall, my experience was very positive <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Janet<\/i><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/janet-s-bahia-principe-akumal-review-8-15-09-a-48951\/\">Our Bahia Principe Akumal Wedding Review (8.15.09)<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20090815\/e\/Our+Destination+Wedding\/k\/c708\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...c708\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcygordon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236617985,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215627.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jananaz","Id":215627,"Name":"Jananaz","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6400,"TotalPages":640,"CurrentPage":220,"NextPage":230,"PreviousPage":210,"LastPage":6390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
