ke the original and just perfect on your body... <br \/> sorry I didnt follow the whole conversation but which website did you use?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrissik82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1255975054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222717.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":64,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrissik82","Id":222717,"Name":"chrissik82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed946f850118c0cb2641a187d52237ea","RawContent":"chrissik- That dress is SOOOOOOOOOOO cute!!!!! I have never seen anything like it!","Attachments":[],"Id":913831,"PostDate":1257466407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                chrissik- That dress is SOOOOOOOOOOO cute!!!!! I have never seen anything like it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Loving married life! <3<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ldhearne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249413540,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220176.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Linds*","Id":220176,"Name":"*Linds*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9760987930e01af5697df57b10c00b6","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;kuteliya&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Ok ive been keeping it quiet for sometime now! Since we are having an AHR, and although we are going to use our wedding attire for the first hour, I planned on changing into a reception dress afterward...Searched all through the threads wondering where to get my AHR dress and i found landybridal to be the most reliable for me! The dress got here today! I rushed over to the PO to pick it up and here are the pics!! Its perfect and fits like a glove!!! Please dont mind my grungy look lol, ive had a very long day but wanted to share these with you!\n \n The original:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/Dress.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n My dress:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/IMG_4757.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n Another view:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/IMG_4758.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Close up on details:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/IMG_4760.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I can&#039;t stress enough how great they were to work with and how absolutely delicate the quality of the dress is! The workmanship is top notch! Thanks again for sharing your stories ladies without your advice I wouldn&#039;t have dared to do it!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That looks great...you must be so excited!! It has certainly made me consider using Landy!! You look so happy!!! Congrats!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":913907,"PostDate":1257468509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>kuteliya<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Ok ive been keeping it quiet for sometime now! Since we are having an AHR, and although we are going to use our wedding attire for the first hour, I planned on changing into a reception dress afterward...Searched all through the threads wondering where to get my AHR dress and i found landybridal to be the most reliable for me! The dress got here today! I rushed over to the PO to pick it up and here are the pics!! Its perfect and fits like a glove!!! Please dont mind my grungy look lol, ive had a very long day but wanted to share these with you!<br \/> <br \/> The original:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/Dress.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> My dress:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/IMG_4757.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Another view:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/IMG_4758.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Close up on details:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i165.photobucket.com\/albums\/u71\/kuteliya\/AHR%20Dress\/IMG_4760.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I can't stress enough how great they were to work with and how absolutely delicate the quality of the dress is! The workmanship is top notch! Thanks again for sharing your stories ladies without your advice I wouldn't have dared to do it!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That looks great...you must be so excited!! It has certainly made me consider using Landy!! You look so happy!!! Congrats!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pstroud2@comcast.ne