"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks Jacilynda for letting me know how to post pictures. So here they are:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/003.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/004.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/002.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n You cant tell from the pictures, but there is soooooo much tulle under the skirt to give it the poofy look...\n And for comparisons sake this is the picture on the website :\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/ttd.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Being new to the forum, I took time to read most of the conversation and came upon the dress posted by Dee that I simply fell in love with. Unfortunately, the photos have since been deleted. Dee do you think you can upload the photos again please? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":915895,"PostDate":1257613934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n 