told me to go the China route &amp;amp; if i end up not liking it as much as the original than he will buy the original &amp;amp; i can use the replica on our TTD...so really i can&#039;t lose..","Attachments":[],"Id":934791,"PostDate":1258763160,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>jdrewett<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm so glad I found this thread. I saw a few dresses on littlecoral.com I love, but still unsure about which style. These are some of my favorites<br \/> :<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.littlecoral.com\/RW08020-f--lace-wedding-dress--bridal-gown_p17720.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>V neckline lace wedding dress, bridal gown [RW08020(f)] - US$267.00 : LittleCoral.com<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.littlecoral.com\/LZ3851-f----keyhole--lace-cheap-wedding-dress-bridal-gown_p17392.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>v neck keyhole back lace cheap wedding dress,bridal gown [LZ3851(f)] - US$274.00 : LittleCoral.com<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.littlecoral.com\/WD09109-f--chiffon-wedding-dress--bridal-gown_p17447.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>beading halter floor length chiffon wedding dress, bridal gown [WD09109(f)] - US$190.00 : LittleCoral.com<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I am getting my dress made from Little Coral too. I'm going to be ordering it in the next 2 weeks so i'll let you all know how it turns out. The original is a $2100 Paloma Blanca and i LOVE it but want to try out the China version first, because i plan on trashing it and they quoted me $270.00!!! Talk about saving some cash...lol<br \/> <br \/> My FI has told me to go the China route & if i end up not liking it as much as the original than he will buy the original & i can use the replica on our TTD...so really i can't lose..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melbc80@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253391218,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221800.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meldal101010","Id":221800,"Name":"meldal101010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84497dc1ea6ef68cfe18cbd7c977e47c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;meldal101010&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I am getting my dress made from Little Coral too. I&#039;m going to be ordering it in the next 2 weeks so i&#039;ll let you all know how it turns out. The original is a $2100 Paloma Blanca and i LOVE it but want to try out the China version first, because i plan on trashing it and they quoted me $270.00!!! Talk about saving some cash...lol\n \n My FI has told me to go the China route &amp;amp; if i end up not liking it as much as the original than he will buy the original &amp;amp; i can use the replica on our TTD...so really i can&#039;t lose..&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That&#039;s great! I cant wait to see how it turns out!! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":935026,"PostDate":1258785149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>meldal101010<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I am getting my dress made from Little Coral too. I'm going to be ordering it in the next 2 weeks so i'll let you all know how it turns out. The original is a $2100 Paloma Blanca and i LOVE it but want to try out the China version first, because i plan on trashing it and they quoted me $270.00!!! Talk about saving some cash...lol<br \/> <br \/> My FI has told me to go the China route & if i end up not liking it as much as the original than he will buy the original & i can use the replica on our TTD...so really i can't lose..<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That's great! I cant wait to see how it turns out!! Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>-Jessica<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jessicamarbut@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1252044680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221310.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":92,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jdrewett","Id":221310,"Name":"jdrewett","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63c13558b7264682590f555dc5e980cc","RawContent":"I think I am about to order my dress from Duosheng, I&#039;ve been looking for like 6 months and nothing ever looks right but I guess I&#039;ll just go with my gut and do it :)","Attachments":[],"Id":935303,"PostDate":1258835350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think I am about to order my dress from Duosheng, I've been looking for like 6 months and nothing ever looks right but I guess I'll just go with my gut and do it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bb