y both would have needed the exact same alterations.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Well that&#039;s not bad. Congrats on such a great buy! I hope I will have the same good experience. Thanks again for posting.\n \n -Anastasia","Attachments":[],"Id":939866,"PostDate":1259156908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>*tanga*<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">My dress is a Maggie destinations replica. I tried it on in the shop. The funny thing is that the real and the fakey both would have needed the exact same alterations.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Well that's not bad. Congrats on such a great buy! I hope I will have the same good experience. Thanks again for posting.<br \/> <br \/> -Anastasia\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adjwedding2010@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252696016,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221533.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"adj","Id":221533,"Name":"adj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":