cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;nicitica&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Tanga, did you post a photo? I must have missed it. what page is it on? i just went through this entire forum. I&#039;m now on a hunt for my TTD dress. I ordered my dress from Macy&#039;s for $3000 and I think it&#039;s a lot of money so i dont want to trash it.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n It&#039;s on page 30 :)","Attachments":[],"Id":941620,"PostDate":1259319480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>nicitica<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Tanga, did you post a photo? I must have missed it. what page is it on? i just went through this entire forum. I'm now on a hunt for my TTD dress. I ordered my dress from Macy's for $3000 and I think it's a lot of money so i dont want to trash it.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> It's on page 30 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/2142\/150\/20100227\/We+Get+Married\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/2142\/...ied\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"joeymosis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233646244,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214576.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*tanga*","Id":214576,"Name":"*tanga*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e067f4140b1b56cebac3fe6ab773477","RawContent":"OMG OMG!! I just got my proof pictures for my dress i&#039;m jumping around the house like a crazy person!! I fell in love with Maggie Sottero&#039;s Lavina but just couldn&#039;t spend $1200 on it. So I had a knockoff made by gianinarbridal. The dress costs $180 with shipping. I first put down a $60 deposit and they just sent me the proof pictures! Now i&#039;ll ok it and finish paying. I&#039;M ECSTATIC! \n \n first the original (I tried it on in a store)\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Now the copy!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/IMG_0003.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/IMG_0007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/IMG_0001.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The beading is a bit different - &amp;quot;lighter&amp;quot; I guess but I just love it! And IT&#039;S MINE!!","Attachments":[],"Id":942143,"PostDate":1259373291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OMG OMG!! I just got my proof pictures for my dress i'm jumping around the house like a crazy person!! I fell in love with Maggie Sottero's Lavina but just couldn't spend $1200 on it. So I had a knockoff made by gianinarbridal. The dress costs $180 with shipping. I first put down a $60 deposit and they just sent me the proof pictures! Now i'll ok it and finish paying. I'M ECSTATIC! <br \/> <br \/> first the original (I tried it on in a store)<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Now the copy!<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/IMG_0003.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/IMG_0007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i650.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu226\/Beaujo85\/IMG_0001.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The beading is a bit different - \"lighter\" I guess but I just love it! And IT'S MINE!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"358b9593c619d28e34879fa335f807a5","RawContent":"Wow KJT the dress looks amazing! You def. have to post pics of you in it once you get it!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":94216