{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.201.2.66","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76787,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1396863582,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82dc31f1f9f8896079a92322bc09ca56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here for sale is my beautiful Maggie Sottero Adorae dress which I wore last month. I literally felt a million dollars in my dress and everyone was amazed by how beautiful it was on, but it is now time to share this beautiful creation with another bride to be at 1\/4 of the rrp price&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sottero and Midgley Bridal Gown made by Maggie Sottero. These dresses are always at the top of the wedding fashion list. The Spring Collection is full of luxury, elegance, and romance.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Adorae is a modern fit and flare wedding dress with a bubble hem. This gorgeous strapless sweetheart bridal gown is adorned with Swarovski crystal beads under the bustline and asymmetrical ruching throughout the bodice and skirt. It is finished off with the perfect Swarovski crystal hip decoration. It has a corset back closure.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nMaggie Sottero wedding dresses will flatter any woman\u2019s body, making every bride shine on her wedding day. This Maggie Sottero corset wedding gown will leave a lasting impression on that special day.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Fabric: Charmeuse (Satin)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This dress is a size 8 but would fit a uk size 6-8-10 as it has a corset back.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;No alterations in the length but alterations in the sides slightly to reduce from us size 8 to uk size 8. I usually wear a uk 8 and it fitted me perfectly with still room in the corset to go up to a size 10 or down to a size 6. The dress can be taken out back to a us size 8 (uk 12-14) quite easily as no material was removed by my seamstress.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have a huge bundle of bridal stuff for sale, this dress and bundle can be bought as a package or any items separately.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adorae dress&lt;\/strong&gt; on its own rrp \u00a31300, I also paid \u00a350 to have an under bustle added so the train can be hooked under at night I will accept \u00a3399 for this dress.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Under hoop&lt;\/strong&gt; which I have on in the picture to keep the dress in the fishtail shape and allows you to walk with ease rrp \u00a380, I will take \u00a320&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Matching brand new and unworn faux &lt;strong&gt;ivory fur bridal shrug&lt;\/strong&gt; with satin fine tie front rrp \u00a340, I will take \u00a320&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cathedral full length veil&lt;\/strong&gt; with comb attachment, truly beautiful as you can see in picture rrp \u00a3160 from the same store I got my dress, I will take \u00a340&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size 5 silver sparkly bridal shoes&lt;\/strong&gt; with silver flower detail, still look new rrp \u00a355, I will take \u00a325&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal jewellery&lt;\/strong&gt; dangly silver earrings and matching Swarovski elements necklace \u00a320&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Swarovski crystal tiara&lt;\/strong&gt; \u00a320&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 x Mori Lee 268 bridesmaid dresses&lt;\/strong&gt; in coral with swarovski broach attached under the bust. \u00a360 each. 1 size 10 and 1 size 16-18&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 x ivory faux fur shrugs&lt;\/strong&gt; to match mine also - \u00a315 each. 1 size 8-12 and 1 size 14-20&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Swarovski crystal hair slide &lt;\/strong&gt;which I wore in the back of my hair \u00a310&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal white automatic umbrella&lt;\/strong&gt; \u00a38&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Silver sparkly matching handbag&lt;\/strong&gt; \u00a310&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bucket of peach coloured silk petals&lt;\/strong&gt;. Around 3000 petals which I made a&amp;nbsp;petal aisle with \u00a37&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Coral and Hot Pick 5mm chiffon material, I used this on my invites, this is whats left over.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Photobooth tan vintage leather suitcase full of 48 props, wigs, glasses, chalkboards, etc ( 2 wicker hats and horse shoe are not included in sale)&amp;nbsp; Hot Pink and Coral chiffo lce attached to the suitcase \u00a340&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sweet table arrangement, 8 glass jars, some Kilner, scoops, love heart chalk board, Pink chiffon lace attached to the sweet jars and scoops \u00a325&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Everything mentioned is in great condition please message me or call me if you would like to come and take a look at anything.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you would like me to courier anything please ask me for a quote, it will be around \u00a325 for the dress alone. We live in Warwickshire if anyone wants to come and view any of these items.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks, Kate x&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":27322,"Name":"IMG_36221.PNG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-39892000-1396876370.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-39892000-1396876370_thumb.png","Width":640,"Height":960},{"Id":27323,"Name":"IMG_36431.PNG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-09493800-1396876511.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-09493800-1396876511_thumb.png","Width":640,"Height":960},{"Id":27324,"Name":"IMG_36501.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-36916700-1396876627.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-36916700-1396876627_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":27325,"Name":"IMG_35392.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-67797800-1396876692.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-67797800-1396876692_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":27326,"Name":"IMG_36571.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-49240500-1396876709.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-49240500-1396876709_thumb.jpg","Width":375,"Height":500},{"Id":27327,"Name":"IMG_36661.PNG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-30137500-1396876825.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277498-0-30137500-1396876825_thumb.png","Width":640,"Height":960}],"Id":1843019,"PostDate":1396862433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here for sale is my beautiful Maggie Sottero Adorae dress which I wore last month. I literally felt a million dollars in my dress and everyone was amazed by how beautiful it was on, but it is now time to share this beautiful creation with another bride to be at 1\/4 of the rrp price<\/p>\n<p>.<\/p>\n<p>Sottero and Midgley Bridal Gown made by Maggie Sottero. These dresses are always at the top of the wedding fashion list. The Spring Collection is full of luxury, elegance, and romance.<\/p>\n<p>The Adorae is a modern fit and flare wedding dress with a bubble hem. This gorgeous strapless sweetheart bridal gown is adorned with Swarovski crystal beads under the bustline and asymmetrical ruching throughout the bodice and skirt. It is finished off with the perfect Swarovski crystal hip decoration. It has a corset back closure.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\nMaggie Sottero wedding dresses will flatter any woman\u2019s body, making every bride shine on her wedding day. This Maggie Sottero corset wedding gown will leave a lasting impression on that special day.<\/p>\n<p>Fabric: Charmeuse (Satin)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This dress is a size 8 but would fit a uk size 6-8-10 as it has a corset back.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>No alterations in the length but alterations in the sides slightly to reduce from us size 8 to uk size 8. I usually wear a uk 8 and it fitted me perfectly with still room in the corset to go up to a size 10 or down to a size 6. The dress can be taken out back to a us size 8 (uk 12-14) quite easily as no material was removed by my seamstress.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have a huge bundle of bridal stuff for sale, this dress and bundle can be bought as a package or any items separately.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Adorae dress<\/strong> on its own rrp \u00a31300, I also paid \u00a350 to have an under bustle added so the train can be hooked under at night I will accept \u00a3399 for this dress.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>The Under hoop<\/strong> which I have on in the picture to keep the dress in the fishtail shape and allows you to walk with ease rrp \u00a380, I will take \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Matching brand new and unworn faux <strong>ivory fur bridal shrug<\/strong> with satin fine tie front rrp \u00a340, I will take \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Cathedral full length veil<\/strong> with comb attachment, truly beautiful as you can see in picture rrp \u00a3160 from the same store I got my dress, I will take \u00a340<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Size 5 silver sparkly bridal shoes<\/strong> with silver flower detail, still look new rrp \u00a355, I will take \u00a325<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal jewellery<\/strong> dangly silver earrings and matching Swarovski elements necklace \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Swarovski crystal tiara<\/strong> \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2 x Mori Lee 268 bridesmaid dresses<\/strong> in coral with swarovski broach attached under the bust. \u00a360 each. 1 size 10 and 1 size 16-18<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2 x ivory faux fur shrugs<\/strong> to match mine also - \u00a315 each. 1 size 8-12 and 1 size 14-20<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Swarovski crystal hair slide <\/strong>which I wore in the back of my hair \u00a310<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal white automatic umbrella<\/strong> \u00a38<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Silver sparkly matching handbag<\/strong> \u00a310<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bucket of peach coloured silk petals<\/strong>. Around 3000 petals which I made a\u00a0petal aisle with \u00a37<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Coral and Hot Pick 5mm chiffon material, I used this on my invites, this is whats left over.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Photobooth tan vintage leather suitcase full of 48 props, wigs, glasses, chalkboards, etc ( 2 wicker hats and horse shoe are not included in sale)\u00a0 Hot Pink and Coral chiffo lce attached to the suitcase \u00a340<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sweet table arrangement, 8 glass jars, some Kilner, scoops, love heart chalk board, Pink chiffon lace attached to the sweet jars and scoops \u00a325<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything mentioned is in great condition please message me or call me if you would like to come and take a look at anything.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you would like me to courier anything please ask me for a quote, it will be around \u00a325 for the dress alone. We live in Warwickshire if anyone wants to come and view any of these items.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks, Kate x<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katew2@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"90.201.2.66","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396861429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"katehoyte","Id":277498,"Name":"katehoyte","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.247.181.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76787,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3409bc170e2da85b255030f8420a9d31","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Im unable to see the pics... would you be able to email them to me at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:annettea1021@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;annettea1021@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843480,"PostDate":1397057154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Im unable to see the pics... would you be able to email them to me at <a href='mailto:annettea1021@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>annettea1021@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"annette.alvarez@me.com","IpAddress":"66.87.116.120","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1355935780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"annettea1021","Id":263375,"Name":"annettea1021","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76787,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6596b857018ae788b370dbcdc85057e1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"katehoyte\"] Why are you selling?:(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843599,"PostDate":1397120678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277498\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277498-katehoyte\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">katehoyte<\/span><\/a> Why are you selling?<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76787,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a87b10bedbc51bb6fd2fdcaac936784","RawContent":"[quote name=\"katehoyte\" post=\"1843019\" timestamp=\"1396876833\"]\nHere for sale is my beautiful Maggie Sottero Adorae dress which I wore last month. I literally felt a million dollars in my dress and everyone was amazed by how beautiful it was on, but it is now time to share this beautiful creation with another bride to be at 1\/4 of the rrp price\n.\nSottero and Midgley Bridal Gown made by Maggie Sottero. These dresses are always at the top of the wedding fashion list. The Spring Collection is full of luxury, elegance, and romance.\nThe Adorae is a modern fit and flare wedding dress with a bubble hem. This gorgeous strapless sweetheart bridal gown is adorned with Swarovski crystal beads under the bustline and asymmetrical ruching throughout the bodice and skirt. It is finished off with the perfect Swarovski crystal hip decoration. It has a corset back closure.\n\nMaggie Sottero wedding dresses will flatter any woman\u2019s body, making every bride shine on her wedding day. This Maggie Sottero corset wedding gown will leave a lasting impression on that special day.\nFabric: Charmeuse (Satin)\n\nThis dress is a size 8 but would fit a uk size 6-8-10 as it has a corset back.\n\nNo alterations in the length but alterations in the sides slightly to reduce from us size 8 to uk size 8. I usually wear a uk 8 and it fitted me perfectly with still room in the corset to go up to a size 10 or down to a size 6. The dress can be taken out back to a us size 8 (uk 12-14) quite easily as no material was removed by my seamstress.\n\nI have a huge bundle of bridal stuff for sale, this dress and bundle can be bought as a package or any items separately.\n\n[b]Adorae dress[\/b] on its own rrp \u00a31300, I also paid \u00a350 to have an under bustle added so the train can be hooked under at night I will accept \u00a3399 for this dress.\n\n[b]The Under hoop[\/b] which I have on in the picture to keep the dress in the fishtail shape and allows you to walk with ease rrp \u00a380, I will take \u00a320\n\nMatching brand new and unworn faux [b]ivory fur bridal shrug[\/b] with satin fine tie front rrp \u00a340, I will take \u00a320\n\n[b]Cathedral full length veil[\/b] with comb attachment, truly beautiful as you can see in picture rrp \u00a3160 from the same store I got my dress, I will take \u00a340\n\n[b]Size 5 silver sparkly bridal shoes[\/b] with silver flower detail, still look new rrp \u00a355, I will take \u00a325\n\n[b]Bridal jewellery[\/b] dangly silver earrings and matching Swarovski elements necklace \u00a320\n\n[b]Swarovski crystal tiara[\/b] \u00a320\n\n[b]2 x Mori Lee 268 bridesmaid dresses[\/b] in coral with swarovski broach attached under the bust. \u00a360 each. 1 size 10 and 1 size 16-18\n\n[b]2 x ivory faux fur shrugs[\/b] to match mine also - \u00a315 each. 1 size 8-12 and 1 size 14-20\n\n[b]Swarovski crystal hair slide [\/b]which I wore in the back of my hair \u00a310\n\n[b]Bridal white automatic umbrella[\/b] \u00a38\n\n[b]Silver sparkly matching handbag[\/b] \u00a310\n\n[b]Bucket of peach coloured silk petals[\/b]. Around 3000 petals which I made a petal aisle with \u00a37\n\nCoral and Hot Pick 5mm chiffon material, I used this on my invites, this is whats left over.\n\nPhotobooth tan vintage leather suitcase full of 48 props, wigs, glasses, chalkboards, etc ( 2 wicker hats and horse shoe are not included in sale)  Hot Pink and Coral chiffo lce attached to the suitcase \u00a340\n\nSweet table arrangement, 8 glass jars, some Kilner, scoops, love heart chalk board, Pink chiffon lace attached to the sweet jars and scoops \u00a325\n\nEverything mentioned is in great condition please message me or call me if you would like to come and take a look at anything.\n\nIf you would like me to courier anything please ask me for a quote, it will be around \u00a325 for the dress alone. We live in Warwickshire if anyone wants to come and view any of these items.\n\nThanks, Kate x[\/quote]\nI&#039;m in love with the bridesmaid dress and sent a pic to my daughter in law. she fell in love with it too, so now we&#039;ve picked it in fuchsia for her!","Attachments":[],"Id":1843752,"PostDate":1397144807,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>katehoyte, on 07 April 2014 - 09:20 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Here for sale is my beautiful Maggie Sottero Adorae dress which I wore last month. I literally felt a million dollars in my dress and everyone was amazed by how beautiful it was on, but it is now time to share this beautiful creation with another bride to be at 1\/4 of the rrp price<\/p>\n<p>.<\/p>\n<p>Sottero and Midgley Bridal Gown made by Maggie Sottero. These dresses are always at the top of the wedding fashion list. The Spring Collection is full of luxury, elegance, and romance.<\/p>\n<p>The Adorae is a modern fit and flare wedding dress with a bubble hem. This gorgeous strapless sweetheart bridal gown is adorned with Swarovski crystal beads under the bustline and asymmetrical ruching throughout the bodice and skirt. It is finished off with the perfect Swarovski crystal hip decoration. It has a corset back closure.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maggie Sottero wedding dresses will flatter any woman\u2019s body, making every bride shine on her wedding day. This Maggie Sottero corset wedding gown will leave a lasting impression on that special day.<\/p>\n<p>Fabric: Charmeuse (Satin)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This dress is a size 8 but would fit a uk size 6-8-10 as it has a corset back.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>No alterations in the length but alterations in the sides slightly to reduce from us size 8 to uk size 8. I usually wear a uk 8 and it fitted me perfectly with still room in the corset to go up to a size 10 or down to a size 6. The dress can be taken out back to a us size 8 (uk 12-14) quite easily as no material was removed by my seamstress.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have a huge bundle of bridal stuff for sale, this dress and bundle can be bought as a package or any items separately.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Adorae dress<\/strong> on its own rrp \u00a31300, I also paid \u00a350 to have an under bustle added so the train can be hooked under at night I will accept \u00a3399 for this dress.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>The Under hoop<\/strong> which I have on in the picture to keep the dress in the fishtail shape and allows you to walk with ease rrp \u00a380, I will take \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Matching brand new and unworn faux <strong>ivory fur bridal shrug<\/strong> with satin fine tie front rrp \u00a340, I will take \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Cathedral full length veil<\/strong> with comb attachment, truly beautiful as you can see in picture rrp \u00a3160 from the same store I got my dress, I will take \u00a340<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Size 5 silver sparkly bridal shoes<\/strong> with silver flower detail, still look new rrp \u00a355, I will take \u00a325<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal jewellery<\/strong> dangly silver earrings and matching Swarovski elements necklace \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Swarovski crystal tiara<\/strong> \u00a320<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2 x Mori Lee 268 bridesmaid dresses<\/strong> in coral with swarovski broach attached under the bust. \u00a360 each. 1 size 10 and 1 size 16-18<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2 x ivory faux fur shrugs<\/strong> to match mine also - \u00a315 each. 1 size 8-12 and 1 size 14-20<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Swarovski crystal hair slide <\/strong>which I wore in the back of my hair \u00a310<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal white automatic umbrella<\/strong> \u00a38<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Silver sparkly matching handbag<\/strong> \u00a310<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bucket of peach coloured silk petals<\/strong>. Around 3000 petals which I made a\u00a0petal aisle with \u00a37<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Coral and Hot Pick 5mm chiffon material, I used this on my invites, this is whats left over.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Photobooth tan vintage leather suitcase full of 48 props, wigs, glasses, chalkboards, etc ( 2 wicker hats and horse shoe are not included in sale)\u00a0 Hot Pink and Coral chiffo lce attached to the suitcase \u00a340<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sweet table arrangement, 8 glass jars, some Kilner, scoops, love heart chalk board, Pink chiffon lace attached to the sweet jars and scoops \u00a325<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything mentioned is in great condition please message me or call me if you would like to come and take a look at anything.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you would like me to courier anything please ask me for a quote, it will be around \u00a325 for the dress alone. We live in Warwickshire if anyone wants to come and view any of these items.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks, Kate x<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm in love with the bridesmaid dress and sent a pic to my daughter in law. she fell in love with it too, so now we've picked it in fuchsia for her!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76787,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb4862ad195bfc84f8d1cc29b45d6168","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I can&#039;t see&amp;nbsp; any of them :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843763,"PostDate":1397147551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I can't see\u00a0 any of them <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76787,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29e92ae49a92e4d2b2bad0d1700a8219","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Can you email me these:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal white automatic umbrella&lt;\/strong&gt; \u00a38&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bucket of peach coloured silk petals&lt;\/strong&gt;. Around 3000 petals which I made a&amp;nbsp;petal aisle with \u00a37&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Coral and Hot Pick 5mm chiffon material, I used this on my invites, this is whats left over.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Photobooth tan vintage leather suitcase full of 48 props, wigs, glasses, chalkboards, etc ( 2 wicker hats and horse shoe are not included in sale)&amp;nbsp; Hot Pink and Coral chiffo lce attached to the suitcase \u00a340&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;lily luu 83 @ gmail . com (no spaces) - thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845083,"PostDate":1397824059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Can you email me these:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal white automatic umbrella<\/strong> \u00a38<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bucket of peach coloured silk petals<\/strong>. Around 3000 petals which I made a\u00a0petal aisle with \u00a37<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Coral and Hot Pick 5mm chiffon material, I used this on my invites, this is whats left over.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Photobooth tan vintage leather suitcase full of 48 props, wigs, glasses, chalkboards, etc ( 2 wicker hats and horse shoe are not included in sale)\u00a0 Hot Pink and Coral chiffo lce attached to the suitcase \u00a340<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>lily luu 83 @ gmail . com (no spaces) - thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id"