{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74053,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f9f6942340a2a012c41dbdf4c626733","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Elegant slim-line tulle and crushed taffeta gown with an attractive empire-line highlighted with a band of taffeta caught at the centre front with a jewel-effect brooch. The tulle is appliqued with corded lace motifs, beaded with twinkling Swarovski crystals and diamante&#039;s and finished with a matching scalloped lace edging.\n \n I absolutely loved this dress but realize I will not wear it again so figured someone else might benefit from it. Its hard to appreciate the detailing and sparkle through the photos. It is absolutely lovely in person.\n \n I have included a link to the dress online.\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bridesonthorndon.co.nz\/wedding_dresses\/essense_wedding_dresses\/essense_wedding_dress_d586.php\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bridesonthorndon.co.nz\/wedding_dresses\/essense_wedding_dresses\/essense_wedding_dress_d586.php&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Let me know if you have any questions!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1761233,"PostDate":1369503512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Elegant slim-line tulle and crushed taffeta gown with an attractive empire-line highlighted with a band of taffeta caught at the centre front with a jewel-effect brooch. The tulle is appliqued with corded lace motifs, beaded with twinkling Swarovski crystals and diamante's and finished with a matching scalloped lace edging.<br \/> <br \/> I absolutely loved this dress but realize I will not wear it again so figured someone else might benefit from it. Its hard to appreciate the detailing and sparkle through the photos. It is absolutely lovely in person.<br \/> <br \/> I have included a link to the dress online.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bridesonthorndon.co.nz\/wedding_dresses\/essense_wedding_dresses\/essense_wedding_dress_d586.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bridesont..._dress_d586.php<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Let me know if you have any questions!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bethellen.webster@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312396598,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Webbie","Id":243199,"Name":"Webbie","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
