{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":105876,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\" data-cid=\"1901796\" data-time=\"1438698300\">Hope the stress levels calm down. Just remember there is a light at the end of the tunnel now. 4 days of work and you are off to paradise. You'll get it done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Sent from my iPhone us...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1901824\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438723280,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105826,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\" data-cid=\"1901796\" data-time=\"1438698300\">Hope the stress levels calm down. Just remember there is a light at the end of the tunnel now. 4 days of work and you are off to paradise. You'll get it done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Sent from my iPhone us...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1901824\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438703757,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105818,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\" data-cid=\"1901796\" data-time=\"1438698300\">Hope the stress levels calm down. Just remember there is a light at the end of the tunnel now. 4 days of work and you are off to paradise. You'll get it done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Sent from my iPhone us...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1901824\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438703133,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105808,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\" data-cid=\"1901796\" data-time=\"1438698300\">Hope the stress levels calm down. Just remember there is a light at the end of the tunnel now. 4 days of work and you are off to paradise. You'll get it done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Sent from my iPhone us...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1901824\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438701852,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105712,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndiadiamond just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm at University and Richmond\/Queen so I can be down there by 5:30! lol And given that it's the Friday right after second quarter\/half year release I will be ready for a drink! (or two or three) 7pm is fine for me but I'll definitely start heading down before that. I'll be so d...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901658\n","Sender":{"Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438684179,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105673,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@calgarybride2015  OMG Kim you're so right!!!!!! (and girl you always are! you always give the girls good advice!)\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1901639\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438652024,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105578,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that calgarybride2015 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79462-puerto-aventuras-wedding-dreams\/?view=findpost&p=1901745\n\n----------------------------------\nWelcome and congrats! Joyce at Dream Weddings is a lady often used by the ladies on this site. She is a member so hopefully she pops in. I know a current bride @\"acw271011\" is using her or has consulted with her. \n\nFor your look a lot of brides use Styling Trio or MVP or Beso Brides just to name a few.  \n\nJust check out the reviews section you can find a lot of vendors for different things <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\nGood luck. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438614063,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105533,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that calgarybride2015 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79457-distressed-and-discouraged\/?view=findpost&p=1901723\n\n----------------------------------\nWelcome!!\n\nI also had an AI wedding with 45 people and the wedding itself was around $5500.  With photography I paid around $7500.   We paid our package over and above that cost plus my dress, decor, favors, etc. \n\nSooooo I'd say it's totally doable!!!    \n\nI've only researched AI but hopefully @\"acw271011\" jumps in as hers is off site.  Another bride used the Venado Beach club (sorry if I spelt that wrong).  Good luck. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438600114,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105516,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that diadiamond mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/?view=findpost&p=1901718\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Yes, the dress I'll be wearing for my wedding is the lace one =)  Sorry for the confusion.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438592056,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105511,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79457-distressed-and-discouraged\/?view=findpost&p=1901714\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"SimpleBliss\" Welcome and congrats on your engagement! Is your $5000-10 000 budget including travel costs for you and your fianc\u00e9? Are you completely opposed to having it at an all inclusive? My resort budget for 60 people for just the wedding was $6000 and we're definitely under that so it is possible but I know you mentioned the all inclusive thing isn't really your first choice.\n \nThere are definitely other options too though (I unfortunately don't have any experience in that department however) with beach clubs, boat cruises and restaurants...not too sure on the range of costs there. @\"acw271011\" may be able to give some words of wisdom as she's planning a small reception off site.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438559255,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105510,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nmelaniegabriele has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Vendor Policies for BDW\".\n\nmelaniegabriele said:\n======================================================================\nhi i just wanted to verify. I read that there are vendor fees available. but I also read  You are allowed 1 thread (in the \"Vendor Marketplace\" Forum) to introduce yourself and post your information advertising your business. Do not post your info in multiple threads.\nis that only with the vendors fee, or is there a one time allowance?\nthank you!\n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n \nhello! thank you so much for the message, i didn't realize there were rules. Going forward i will read and follow them<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"acw271011\" data-time=\"1438370624\">Good afternoon,\n\nI noted that you've posted your services for brides to be planning a wedding in the DR. Thank you so much for offering this service to the ladies here on BDW. I'm certain with all of the brides that do go to the Dominican Republic that it's a service that will be helpful to them!\n\nI did want to let you know that there are certain policies and sign up processes for vendors that would like to offer their services here. It just puts all of the vendors on a level playing field.\n\nIf you go back to the home page and go right to the bottom, you'll see a line that says 'Advertise on BDW\". Just complete that inquiry form and someone will be back in touch with you. There is a fee for vendors to advertise here.\n\nAgain, thanks so much for offering your services to the ladies here! There are several as you've no doubt read that do have their wedding in the DR.\n\nI wish you all the best!\n-----------------------------\n\n <\/blockquote> \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10882&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":284226,"Name":"melaniegabriele","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438556136,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10882},{"Id":105500,"Title":"liked a post you made in How To Choose A Maid Of Honor","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongrats and welcome! If you do a search up top in the search bar on bridesmaid drama you'll get any number of pages to read!! It's an ongoing dilemma for many brides to be.\n \nIf it was me, and you know they don't like each other, and you know there will be trouble if you chos...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79446-how-to-choose-a-maid-of-honor\/?view=findpost&p=1901659\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438540823,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105465,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that vancouverpetunia mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1901690\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Maybe try calling the 800 number they list on the Vistaprint web site? I haven't called, but it says they are available to help. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438468155,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105391,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMrsCtoB just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHere's your giggle for the night ladies. I had to work late tonight. (so what else is new?) Hubby left with the trailer so I have the house to myself until I drive to meet up with him on Saturday a couple of hours away in New York.  I got home and decided rather than driving to my gf's wi...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1901629\n","Sender":{"Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438431044,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105382,"Title":"liked a post you made in Joannabanana's Planning...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  There's an online store called Paper Garden (I think that's it). I used them when we got married 4 years ago and their paper prices are amazing! They also have the fold over envelopes as well as the special square size ones that would work for passport and boarding pass invites. I found the...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/?view=findpost&p=1901643\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438426345,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105371,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\nmelaniegabriele has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Vendor Policies for BDW\".\n\nmelaniegabriele said:\n======================================================================\nhello! thank you so much for the message, i didn't realize there were rules. Going forward i will read and follow them\n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nGood afternoon,\n\nI noted that you've posted your services for brides to be planning a wedding in the DR. Thank you so much for offering this service to the ladies here on BDW. I'm certain with all of the brides that do go to the Dominican Republic that it's a service that will be helpful to them!\n\nI did want to let you know that there are certain policies and sign up processes for vendors that would like to offer their services here. It just puts all of the vendors on a level playing field.\n\nIf you go back to the home page and go right to the bottom, you'll see a line that says 'Advertise on BDW\". Just complete that inquiry form and someone will be back in touch with you. There is a fee for vendors to advertise here.\n\nAgain, thanks so much for offering your services to the ladies here! There are several as you've no doubt read that do have their wedding in the DR.\n\nI wish you all the best!\n-----------------------------\n\n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10882&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":284226,"Name":"melaniegabriele","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438415324,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10882},{"Id":105370,"Title":"liked a post you made in Nkavanaugh Grand Sirenis Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi and welcome! I've been a bit MIA since we're on holiday this week and oh my lord I'm going to have SO much to get caught up on when I get home!Your dress is beautiful and I love the jacket over it!! Bridesmaid dresses are great for that kind of price? Definitely can't complain! The colour is...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79423-nkavanaugh-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-may-3rd2016\/?view=findpost&p=1901060\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438400858,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105354,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm at University and Richmond\/Queen so I can be down there by 5:30! lol And given that it's the Friday right after second quarter\/half year release I will be ready for a drink! (or two or three) 7pm is fine for me but I'll definitely start heading down before that. I'll be so d...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901658\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438362165,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105353,"Title":"liked a post you made in Joannabanana's Planning...","Message":"Hello!\n\nJoannaBanana just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  There's an online store called Paper Garden (I think that's it). I used them when we got married 4 years ago and their paper prices are amazing! They also have the fold over envelopes as well as the special square size ones that would work for passport and boarding pass invites. I found the...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/?view=findpost&p=1901643\n","Sender":{"Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1438361360,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105352,"Title":"liked a post you made in How To Choose A Maid Of Honor","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongrats and welcome! If you do a search up top in the search bar on bridesmaid drama you'll get any number of pages to read!! It's an ongoing dilemma for many brides to be.\n \nIf it was me, and you know they don't like each other, and you know there will be trouble if you chos...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79446-how-to-choose-a-maid-of-honor\/?view=findpost&p=1901659\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1438177324","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438360783,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105350,"Title":"liked a post you made in How To Choose A Maid Of Honor","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCongrats and welcome! If you do a search up top in the search bar on bridesmaid drama you'll get any number of pages to read!! It's an ongoing dilemma for many brides to be.\n \nIf it was me, and you know they don't like each other, and you know there will be trouble if you chos...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79446-how-to-choose-a-maid-of-honor\/?view=findpost&p=1901659\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438358559,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105347,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm at University and Richmond\/Queen so I can be down there by 5:30! lol And given that it's the Friday right after second quarter\/half year release I will be ready for a drink! (or two or three) 7pm is fine for me but I'll definitely start heading down before that. I'll be so d...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901658\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438356430,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105343,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm at University and Richmond\/Queen so I can be down there by 5:30! lol And given that it's the Friday right after second quarter\/half year release I will be ready for a drink! (or two or three) 7pm is fine for me but I'll definitely start heading down before that. I'll be so d...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901658\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1435850174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438356007,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105306,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901649\n\n----------------------------------\nYes the more the merrier!! All are welcome!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I figured O&B would be a good choice, especially with the location for those needing the go train after and I really like their patio as well. \n@\"acw271011\" you were right there was someone I missed on the list but I couldn't remember where I saw her and on what thread. haha - oh my short term memory....anyway after searching through the threads I found it!!\n \n@Laurena1229 (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283004-laurena1229\/) you are more than welcome to join us on the 14th if you're free for drinks on a patio!!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438347459,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105295,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I agree with @  I can't see any reason why you can't join in. As she said, the more the merrier! I think we're still finalizing the location. @  mentioned some but not sure everyone yet has come back with a \"yes\". I can see Young & Front being a good central for everyone I think. Just h...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901641\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438346627,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105292,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@calgarybride2015  OMG Kim you're so right!!!!!! (and girl you always are! you always give the girls good advice!)\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1901639\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438345158,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105288,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@calgarybride2015  OMG Kim you're so right!!!!!! (and girl you always are! you always give the girls good advice!)\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1901639\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1438177324","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438343251,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105285,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@snswedding2016  I agree. Hopefully the patio location will be open but anything can go wrong.\n \nLadies - I'm open to suggestions. I'm afraid I'm not very good with things downtown. I just found out we're having our Xmas doo at Copa Cabana on Adelaide. Don't know anything...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901605\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1438177324","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438340247,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105268,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that diadiamond mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901642\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"  Thanks hun!  Sorry I haven't read a lot of the posts yet, I still need to catch up =p  I followed the topic, so I'll be able to see updates as they become available.  I'm so excited to meet you, we live and work pretty close to each other too!  I work near Queen and Bay. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1392867144","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438337770,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":105264,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndiadiamond just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I agree with @  I can't see any reason why you can't join in. As she said, the more the merrier! I think we're still finalizing the location. @  mentioned some but not sure everyone yet has come back with a \"yes\". I can see Young & Front being a good central for everyone I think. Just h...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1901641\n","Sender":{"Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-27