100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Pro definitely. Hair and makeup for sure!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.36.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22ecddf7ba3f1989401d4e66e502c44f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes to pro MUA. We wanted our pictures to be taken at our best.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868345,"PostDate":1408741094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes to pro MUA. We wanted our pictures to be taken at our best.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our Awesome <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wevideo.com\/hub\/#media\/ci\/113639543'>Video<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/itslegendary2014.wix.com\/fasa'>Website<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/'>Riu Palace Riviera Maya Planning Thread<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1864158'>Pre-wedding photos<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878020'>OOT Baskets<\/a>, <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878578'>Centrepieces<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1852686'>DIY - Giant Crepe Roses<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867378'>DIY - Hangers & Boutonnieres<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867696'>DIY - Kissing Menu\/I Spy & Guestbook<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/page-6#entry1878023'>More DIYs - Passport to Riviera Maya, Bookmarks, Tumbler Inserts, Luggage Tags, Keycard Holder Inserts, Something Special for You Inserts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"elsa_jam@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"23.16.109.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372273518,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270962.png?_r=1397000926","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Icis","Id":270962,"Name":"Icis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.69.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6a09970ffbc71714fecd6c6acc53676","RawContent":"I&#039;ve also been debating this. A wedding guest has offered to do my makeup. While thats such a generous and thoughtful offer, I also want to make sure that&#039;s a good decision. I told her we have to do a couple makeup trials beforehand and I can decide from that :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1868357,"PostDate":1408747166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've also been debating this. A wedding guest has offered to do my makeup. While thats such a generous and thoughtful offer, I also want to make sure that's a good decision. I told her we have to do a couple makeup trials beforehand and I can decide from that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jolie.vidal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408543857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideToBeJolie","Id":279500,"Name":"BrideToBeJolie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecce9259e3ef3d2f93eaf862a476b11f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;YES! I want to feel comfortable and beautiful on my day.... and I don&#039;t want to put that kind of pressure on myself for any of my guests. Definitely worth the few hundred to have a professional.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868477,"PostDate":1408873972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>YES! I want to feel comfortable and beautiful on my day.... and I don't want to put that kind of pressure on myself for any of my guests. Definitely worth the few hundred to have a professional.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391606556,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.153.157.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e36d2b8041670b75101be79154dd4d27","RawContent":"This is also what I am thinking. I really wanted to bring in an outside make up artist, but I&#039;m stuck on the vendor fee. It is just me - no bridal party - so the vendor fee is way more than the fee to do my make up. PLUS, my fianc\u00e9 feels strongly that I should look like ME on our wedding day. So, I&#039;m hesitant to go to out of the ordinary on my make up (no lashes). I&#039;ve heard the resort doesn&#039;t use very high quality make up so I may get a lesson and practice ahead of time so I can do it myself. \n\nI&#039;ll have my hair done at the spa - I may do a trial once I get there just to make me feel better about it. I want my hair up, but I don&#039;t want it to look super formal. More beachy. \n[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1868316\" timestamp=\"1408748800\"]\nDefinately getting hair done at the spa but debating getting a makeup consult at MAC in town and doing my own there. Haven&#039;t decided.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1868491,"PostDate":1408880949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is also what I am thinking. I really wanted to bring in an outside make up artist, but I'm stuck on the vendor fee. It is just me - no bridal party - so the vendor fee is way more than the fee to do my make up. PLUS, my fianc\u00e9 feels strongly that I should look like ME on our wedding day. So, I'm hesitant to go to out of the ordinary on my make up (no lashes). I've heard the resort doesn't use very high quality make up so I may get a lesson and practice ahead of time so I can do it myself.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll have my hair done at the spa - I may do a trial once I get there just to make me feel better about it. I want my hair up, but I don't want it to look super formal. More beachy.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 22 August 2014 - 07:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Definately getting hair done at the spa but debating getting a makeup consult at MAC in town and doing my own there. Haven't decided.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bda18c3619796bf0888bd1bfce5a95be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I went to sephora yesterday and they said you can make a 45 min makeup appt where they will show you things to do, you just have to commit to buy 50$ worth of product (not hard to do). I was thinking of going and bringing my MOH . For my hair, I was just going to have my MOH do a trial with me - all i want is my hair down with curls\/waves. If I wanted an updo, I would probably have a pro do it&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868492,"PostDate":1408881299,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I went to sephora yesterday and they said you can make a 45 min makeup appt where they will show you things to do, you just have to commit to buy 50$ worth of product (not hard to do). I was thinking of going and bringing my MOH . For my hair, I was just going to have my MOH do a trial with me - all i want is my hair down with curls\/waves. If I wanted an updo, I would probably have a pro do it<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406722272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2149f3cdf572dcee19e8f22c00946046","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1868491\" timestamp=\"1408895349\"]\nThis is also what I am thinking. I really wanted to bring in an outside make up artist, but I&#039;m stuck on the vendor fee. It is just me - no bridal party - so the vendor fee is way more than the fee to do my make up. PLUS, my fianc\u00e9 feels strongly that I should look like ME on our wedding day. So, I&#039;m hesitant to go to out of the ordinary on my make up (no lashes). I&#039;ve heard the resort doesn&#039;t use very high quality make up so I may get a lesson and practice ahead of time so I can do it myself. \n\nI&#039;ll have my hair done at the spa - I may do a trial once I get there just to make me feel better about it. I want my hair up, but I don&#039;t want it to look super formal. More beachy.[\/quote]\nI also want to look like me but also want flawless photo skin ha!  I know I can have both, but need some help!\nI am still undecided about going to MAC or doing it at the spa, but atleast with MAC I get the products to keep.  My bridesmaid married last year and had the MAC lady come to her home to do her makeup - she was good, so if we do this we plan to use her. \n\nI have shorter hair (chin length) so there isn&#039;t much that can be done. I am going to get a trial at home with my stylist and we are going to take a lot of pictures and hope she can reproduce.","Attachments":[],"Id":1868495,"PostDate":1408881599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 24 August 2014 - 11:49 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This is also what I am thinking. I really wanted to bring in an outside make up artist, but I'm stuck on the vendor fee. It is just me - no bridal party - so the vendor fee is way more than the fee to do my make up. PLUS, my fianc\u00e9 feels strongly that I should look like ME on our wedding day. So, I'm hesitant to go to out of the ordinary on my make up (no lashes). I've heard the resort doesn't use very high quality make up so I may get a lesson and practice ahead of time so I can do it myself.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll have my hair done at the spa - I may do a trial once I get there just to make me feel better about it. I want my hair up, but I don't want it to look super formal. More beachy.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also want to look like me but also want flawless photo skin ha! \u00a0I know I can have both, but need some help!<\/p>\n<p>I am still undecided about going to MAC or doing it at the spa, but atleast with MAC I get the products to keep. \u00a0My bridesmaid married last year and had the MAC lady come to her home to do her makeup - she was good, so if we do this we plan to use her.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have shorter hair (chin length) so there isn't much that can be done. I am going to get a trial at home with my stylist and we are going to take a lot of pictures and hope she can reproduce.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":28,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":5,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
