{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.213.179.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4a9f83c4d700a48d546f57bd08b8431","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nadiakat17\" post=\"1868492\" timestamp=\"1408895699\"]\nI went to sephora yesterday and they said you can make a 45 min makeup appt where they will show you things to do, you just have to commit to buy 50$ worth of product (not hard to do). I was thinking of going and bringing my MOH . For my hair, I was just going to have my MOH do a trial with me - all i want is my hair down with curls\/waves. If I wanted an updo, I would probably have a pro do it[\/quote]\nNow that&#039;s not a bad idea at all! I&#039;m spending so much on the venue and photographer that doing my own makeup is a way to save a few bucks! Thanks for sharing this tip!","Attachments":[],"Id":1872891,"PostDate":1411502748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nadiakat17, on 24 August 2014 - 11:54 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nI went to sephora yesterday and they said you can make a 45 min makeup appt where they will show you things to do, you just have to commit to buy 50$ worth of product (not hard to do). I was thinking of going and bringing my MOH . For my hair, I was just going to have my MOH do a trial with me - all i want is my hair down with curls\/waves. If I wanted an updo, I would probably have a pro do it<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nNow that's not a bad idea at all! I'm spending so much on the venue and photographer that doing my own makeup is a way to save a few bucks! Thanks for sharing this tip!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"travis.denise@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.97.137.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376604232,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272639.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nissi324","Id":272639,"Name":"Nissi324","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.31.106.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dac12726ceffe7b1dbafc516cfa89ce0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My package includes hair and makeup. But I don&#039;t have much confidence they&#039;re know how to handle my hair or have makeup that complements my skin tone. So I&#039;ll likely end up doing both myself.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873085,"PostDate":1411638937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My package includes hair and makeup. But I don't have much confidence they're know how to handle my hair or have makeup that complements my skin tone. So I'll likely end up doing both myself.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.254.151.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0975547b8daa8e0d5d5b174dfa308a7e","RawContent":"My package also includes hair and makeup, I haven&#039;t gotten feedback about the salon at Now Larimar but hopefully someone knows.  I am going to bring my own makeup just in case I don&#039;t like what they are using.","Attachments":[],"Id":1873855,"PostDate":1412094672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My package also includes hair and makeup, I haven't gotten feedback about the salon at Now Larimar but hopefully someone knows.  I am going to bring my own makeup just in case I don't like what they are using.  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405976695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279112.jpg?_r=1429983331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"alwalters625","Id":279112,"Name":"alwalters625","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02b4fe47c56198f0f807aabe55b1e213","RawContent":"My package includes my hair, but makeup is $70 at the resort&#039;s salon. I think I may just do that. I don&#039;t have any friends who are makeup artists and I suck at makeup. My friend who got married in Florida said to def go with airbrush so I plan to do that, even if it&#039;s extra! I don&#039;t want to sweat it out! I read a review where the bride and her bridal party got their hair and makeup done at the resort and it looked good so I&#039;m not worried.","Attachments":[],"Id":1873889,"PostDate":1412114255,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My package includes my hair, but makeup is $70 at the resort's salon. I think I may just do that. I don't have any friends who are makeup artists and I suck at makeup. My friend who got married in Florida said to def go with airbrush so I plan to do that, even if it's extra! I don't want to sweat it out! I read a review where the bride and her bridal party got their hair and makeup done at the resort and it looked good so I'm not worried. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401612892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.6.126.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79b424bb9507574e550e5b83ba816071","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I used airbrush makeup for the first time last year as a bridesmaid in my brother&#039;s wedding. It was wonderful! Being of a particular age, I have personal summers, and much to my comfort the airbrush makeup didn&#039;t run, nor did it come off when wiping my brow! For my wedding, I already have my airbrush and lashes appointment and my locks are being styled by someone different. Both will be coming to my hotel suite the morning of my wedding! It is well worth the money to go professional. Hope this helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873943,"PostDate":1412170989,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I used airbrush makeup for the first time last year as a bridesmaid in my brother's wedding. It was wonderful! Being of a particular age, I have personal summers, and much to my comfort the airbrush makeup didn't run, nor did it come off when wiping my brow! For my wedding, I already have my airbrush and lashes appointment and my locks are being styled by someone different. Both will be coming to my hotel suite the morning of my wedding! It is well worth the money to go professional. Hope this helps!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Love over 50 is still LOVE!!!<\/p>\n<p>Invitations out! RSVPs in<\/p>\n<p>Us, them (bridal party), + 48 guests!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"dldincali@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.8.177.213","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399049737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277818.jpg?_r=1408642386","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":143,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VegasBride121314","Id":277818,"Name":"VegasBride121314","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5e65ebcc64dd1a5bf27d28c6f2c907b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Pro make-up but having my fiance&#039;s step-mom do my hair (she&#039;s a stylist) to help save some money. We&#039;re able to practice at homebeforehand and I can show her all the Pinterst pins I want :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873949,"PostDate":1412174319,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Pro make-up but having my fiance's step-mom do my hair (she's a stylist) to help save some money. We're able to practice at homebeforehand and I can show her all the Pinterst pins I want <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"135.23.55.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f39cfd54b4032609ede97db587765c4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am an experienced MAKEUP ARTIST from Toronto Canada. I will be moving to Punta Cana DR for the winter (Nov 30 2015-March 30 2016) I&#039;m planning and would LOVE to work on you beautiful destination brides. As of right now I have just confirmed my trip so am now available to start booking.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;here is my website and social media if you would like to check out my work&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you in advance and happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.melaniegabriele.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;instagram: @melaniegabriele&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;email: melaniegabriele@live.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901657,"PostDate":1438353519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>I am an experienced MAKEUP ARTIST from Toronto Canada. I will be moving to Punta Cana DR for the winter (Nov 30 2015-March 30 2016) I'm planning and would LOVE to work on you beautiful destination brides. As of right now I have just confirmed my trip so am now available to start booking.<\/p>\n<p>here is my website and social media if you would like to check out my work<\/p>\n<p>Thank you in advance and happy planning!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>www.melaniegabriele.com<\/p>\n<p>instagram: @melaniegabriele<\/p>\n<p>email: melaniegabriele@live.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melaniegabriele@live.com","IpAddress":"135.23.55.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438352678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"melaniegabriele","Id":284226,"Name":"melaniegabriele","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8a0653f916f68076cc736deaf5ad70e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hey for wedding day you must prefer only professional hair and makeup artist because the way they do all the finishing in the make up and hair style no other non professional can do it. and its going to be one of the important day of your life so you must look very gorgeous as you will remember that day the rest of your life.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901876,"PostDate":1438745028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hey for wedding day you must prefer only professional hair and makeup artist because the way they do all the finishing in the make up and hair style no other non professional can do it. and its going to be one of the important day of your life so you must look very gorgeous as you will remember that day the rest of your life.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425086317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":28,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":5,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
