{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21020eb9bcb9541ab95c4971c069a6d8","RawContent":"Hmmm... I saw this thread and thought that I may use it for some help. I&#039;m having such a hard time deciding between 2 dresses. I have lots of time until the wedding (october) but it&#039;s bothering me that i cna&#039;t make a decision. My mom and bridesmaids all are torn with their picks too. Perhaps you ladies can help me decide.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n20\/Mayotte7\/weddingdresses013.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n20\/Mayotte7\/weddingdresses016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":21031,"PostDate":1169960958,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hmmm... I saw this thread and thought that I may use it for some help. I'm having such a hard time deciding between 2 dresses. I have lots of time until the wedding (october) but it's bothering me that i cna't make a decision. My mom and bridesmaids all are torn with their picks too. Perhaps you ladies can help me decide.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n20\/Mayotte7\/weddingdresses013.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n20\/Mayotte7\/weddingdresses013.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n20\/Mayotte7\/weddingdresses016.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n20\/Mayotte7\/weddingdresses016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.ayotte@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.27.238.196","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1169948520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207103.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Melissa~","Id":207103,"Name":"~Melissa~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee8811bd00a3194da9e99a3db1ffc256","RawContent":"okay, first one, but picture it strapless, this picture doesn&#039;t even do the dress justice!\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jill1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n this one, but without the sleeves\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jill2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I love this one too, but I think the train is too much, but the detail is gorgeous\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bonny.com\/index.php?option=com_staticxt&amp;amp;staticfile=gowns.php?id=757&amp;amp;gline=6&amp;amp;start_page=36&amp;amp;featured=N\"&gt;Bonny MT Enterprises Co. Ltd. - Celebrating 20 years of Elegance and Quality&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;12\/08\/08 - LINK NOT WORKING&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n \n \n And the last one I can&#039;t post because I have no picture of it, but I really loved it. If I get it I&#039;ll post a picture then!\n \n Let me know what you think!","Attachments":[],"Id":22877,"PostDate":1170378005,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                okay, first one, but picture it strapless, this picture doesn't even do the dress justice!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?keywordText=bordeaux&keywordType=any&page=0&pageSize=8&style=A583' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MaggieSottero.com - Dress Detail<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jill1.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jill1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> this one, but without the sleeves<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?keywordText=Rosemary+Leigh&keywordType=any&page=0&pageSize=8&style=J192' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MaggieSottero.com - Dress Detail<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jill2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jill2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> I love this one too, but I think the train is too much, but the detail is gorgeous<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bonny.com\/index.php?option=com_staticxt&staticfile=gowns.php?id=757&gline=6&start_page=36&featured=N' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Bonny MT Enterprises Co. Ltd. - Celebrating 20 years of Elegance and Quality<\/a><br \/> <strong>12\/08\/08 - LINK NOT WORKING<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> And the last one I can't post because I have no picture of it, but I really loved it. If I get it I'll post a picture then!<br \/> <br \/> Let me know what you think!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jill@...","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1162169940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206877.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*JillD*","Id":206877,"Name":"*JillD*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb3ab1ec7d6042ebbad5484a58520abd","RawContent":"I bought my dress over a year ago. Originally we were going to get married on an Alaskan cruise. Now Im not sure if I like the dress to get married in Mexico... \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i168.photobucket.com\/albums\/u187\/chicago80\/9fa5_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":23040,"PostDate":1170436952,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I bought my dress over a year ago. Originally we were going to get married on an Alaskan cruise. Now Im not sure if I like the dress to get married in Mexico... <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/i168.photobucket.com\/albums\/u187\/chicago80\/9fa5_2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i168.photobucket.com\/albums\/u187\/chicago80\/9fa5_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisyPath.com\/days\/071110\/1\/1\/-6\/1\/.png\">http:\/\/daisyPath.com\/days\/071110\/1\/1\/-6\/1\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amberfw80@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1169776970,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"